dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=efb4beda2d9357b99a20634efcefd027 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/98702c05/uploads/origins/7fcd1221-b77a-4724-a52d-780350a2c4a3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=19f293e4314ab9c68b8f15cc4873582e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/98702c05/uploads/origins/7fcd1221-b77a-4724-a52d-780350a2c4a3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=19f293e4314ab9c68b8f15cc4873582e, https://si.imgix.net/98702c05/uploads/origins/7fcd1221-b77a-4724-a52d-780350a2c4a3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=02d67bbe25ef7536c0c626f16c0e5580 2x, https://si.imgix.net/98702c05/uploads/origins/7fcd1221-b77a-4724-a52d-780350a2c4a3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cfa1858f37088785aa307e329bf3ea98 3x"}, "body": "Hello, teacher!\n\nCould you please draw these two characters of mine? I fell in love with how expressive and charming your artwork was at first sight!\n\nThe setting is two thieves who live in seclusion while on the run from the Sultan. They steal the holy water of immortality, a crime worse than murder. The two travel together across the country as partners. The setting is similar to the continent of Tral in “FFXIV” and the manga \"Magi.\n\nThe costumes of the characters I want you to use are in the folder [☀️🌊]\n\nKai (💥 194cm) \nA troublemaker who escaped from the Sun Tribe. He loves money, fighting, and pleasure. He is a crude but capable young man who attracts many people.\nHe is a bad man, cocky and shameless.\nLaid-back.\nDoes not stay in one place very often. Likes to experience everything life has to offer.\nHe likes to tease and flirt with Asa in a childish way, but is always surprised by Asa's sincerity. Asa makes Kai want to be a better person.\n\nAsa (🌊 183cm) \nis from the rain tribe. He steals the water of immortality to save his tribe. He is secretive but gentle and kind.\nHe is principled, trustworthy, and resourceful. He is good with children and grandmothers.\nHe gets along well with others and does not disappoint.\nHe thinks Kai is a maniac, but is willing to be carried away by his rhythms. Asa tolerates Kai's antics. Kai motivates Asa to try unknown opportunities.\n\nI will leave the details to you. Thank you in advance for your consideration! \n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1jt4VVyJdRullzm-nrtk8KDo7nctJrjva", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [{"path": "/@CcStars44/works/39", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1572, "client_id": 3560617, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d50f36ed/uploads/origins/c18abebb-1b90-4092-9265-11f5bcc658b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c7f946b7f1c830509b04d342f99a1c09", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d50f36ed/uploads/origins/c18abebb-1b90-4092-9265-11f5bcc658b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c7f946b7f1c830509b04d342f99a1c09, https://si.imgix.net/d50f36ed/uploads/origins/c18abebb-1b90-4092-9265-11f5bcc658b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4a0cba0dfbc8c1411138926fd290972d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d50f36ed/uploads/origins/c18abebb-1b90-4092-9265-11f5bcc658b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b1c0960a6eeee5d95440c7aa87d7b9a6 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d50f36ed/uploads/origins/c18abebb-1b90-4092-9265-11f5bcc658b1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=25ba43a5cf004c1aa1863ed1aff0e7ab", "srcset": "https